== a script does not change into a directory named as a command:
script.sh:1:1: error: The command 'sub' was not found.
status=127
-c:1:1: error: The command 'sub' was not found.
status=127
WORK
== an interactive shell does:
WORK/sub
== KOSHCONF carries no semantic option:
kosh.editor.auto_close_brackets_and_quotes=on                       interactive
kosh.optimizer.analyze_before_running=on                            semantic
kosh.interpreter.resolve_koshkit_applets_as_commands=off            semantic
kosh.interpreter.mimic_shebang=off                                  semantic
kosh.debug.report_nonzero_exit_codes=off                            semantic
kosh.debug.report_every_exit_code=off                               semantic
another shell
